{"id":"signal","lemma":"Signal","pos":"noun","rank":1485,"glosses":["signal"],"ipa":"/zɪˈɡnaːl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1d/De-Signal.ogg/De-Signal.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Signales","plural":"Signale"},"examples":[{"text":"Das Signal war rot.","en":"The signal was red.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"red"}]},{"text":"Dieses Signal bedeutet \"nicht gehen\".","en":"This signal means \"don't walk.\"","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"to imply","l":"bedeuten"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Er gab uns das Signal anzufangen.","en":"He gave us the signal to begin.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to begin","l":"anfangen"}]},{"text":"Schnallen Sie sich bitte an, und halten Sie sich an das Rauchverbot, bis das Signal erlischt!","en":"Please fasten your seat belt and observe the \"no smoking\" sign until it is turned off.","words":[{"g":"to fasten with a clasp"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to hold"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"until, to, through"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to become extinguished","l":"erlöschen"}]}]}